OL,3,GNEWSA'Man and child' break into pub and
OL,4,Aflood cellar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a child broke into a pub and
OL,7,F"flooded" the cellar while stealing
OL,8,Fcopper pipes, a landlord has said.
OL,10,FJamie Thomas, the new owner of the
OL,11,FErnehale Pub in Arnold,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, said what the pair
OL,13,Ftook was worth about #20 in scrap, but
OL,14,Fthe repairs would cost him thousands.
OL,16,FThe 30-year-old, who is renovating the
OL,17,Fformer Wetherspoons pub, said the
OL,18,Fbreak-in at about 19:30 BST on Sunday
OL,19,Fwas stressful, but he would "get on"
OL,20,Fwith the work needed to reopen in
OL,21,FNovember as planned.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
